{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Propagate continuation failures into the execution.** `WaitForConditionOperation` does not observe these returned futures. If replay-state deserialization or next-worker dispatch throws, this only fails the observation future and releases the activity lease, allowing endless suspension/replay; JVM-fatal errors are also swallowed. Fail or terminate the owner through the manager, then rethrow JVM-fatal failures after settling the observation future.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77sbht","finding_digest":"03e3dab64ed1cd09a776a4407e6e5b0e2c6f74d20999234577c117a7b9ad21ea","finding_id":"arf_v1_apr5vnso2hgqtj3wurah43s3by","finding_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::completecheckpointcontinuation::jvm-fatal-swallowing","identity_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::completecheckpointcontinuation::jvm-fatal-swallowing","line":600,"observation_digest":"b9387d3f3d02875b62402b9764a029423b386eca38c19e234d7af436ff11e5d9","observation_id":"aro_v1_xe4h2pz5akdvwysafolwjibjii","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_apr5vnso2hgqtj3wurah43s3by","published_at":"2026-10-08T18:31:10Z","review_id":"arr_v1_3ad56x3tucxpdx6v3vndafnqmc","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"40597b3393d2260883ae37b45d978685d2144a31","reviewer":"codex","start_line":599,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_g3k3dlchh3kce7stsp7ytpqsfc","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T18:31:10Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
